# Trim 1.0

The app is `mobile/` (Expo + Expo Router). Read `AGENTS.md` first.

- Product model: `PRODUCT.md`; changes to it: `PRODUCT-DECISIONS.md`.
- Visual rules: `.cursor/skills/trim-ui/SKILL.md`, then `.cursor/skills/implement-screen/SKILL.md`.
- Never rename the `scratchWorkout.*` storage keys, the `ScratchWorkout` bundle IDs, the `scratchworkout` scheme or the `Scratch Pro` entitlement (see *Names that must not change* in `AGENTS.md`).
- Update `PRODUCT-DECISIONS.md` and `trim-ui` in the same change when behavior or design rules change.
